(SMART URBAN INFRASTRUCTURE AUTHORITY \(SUIA\)) '
(REQUEST FOR PROPOSAL \(RFP\)) '
(Tender Title: Smart City Integrated IoT Command & Cloud Infrastructure Platform) '
(Reference Number: SUIA/2026/IOT-RFP-098) '
(Estimated Project Value: INR 8.50 Crore \(INR 85,000,000\)) '
(Bid Submission Deadline: 30 Days from Notice Date) '
(Project Execution Location: Central Command Facility and City Smart Zones) '
() '
(SECTION 1: STATUTORY ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA) '
(1.1 Legal Status and Incorporation:) '
(The Bidder must be a registered legal corporate entity under the Companies Act in continuous commercial operation for at least 5 years.) '
(1.2 Industry Specialization:) '
(The Bidder must demonstrate proven operational experience in Information Technology, Cloud Infrastructure, and Enterprise Software Solutions.) '
(1.3 Non-Blacklisting Declaration:) '
(The Bidder must submit a formal affidavit on non-judicial stamp paper confirming the firm is not blacklisted by any Central or State Government authority.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
