stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 780 Td 14 TL
(SECTION 2: FINANCIAL & ACCREDITED CERTIFICATION QUALIFICATIONS) '
(2.1 Minimum Average Annual Financial Turnover:) '
(The Bidder must have an average annual turnover of not less than INR 5.00 Crore \(INR 50,000,000\) during the preceding three audited financial years. CA audit certificate with UDIN must be enclosed.) '
(2.2 Positive Net Worth:) '
(The Bidder must possess a positive net worth as of the latest audited balance sheet.) '
(2.3 Mandatory Quality & Security Certifications:) '
(The Bidder MUST hold active and accredited ISO 9001:2015 \(Quality Management System\) and ISO/IEC 27001 \(Information Security Management\) certifications on the date of bid submission.) '
(2.4 Optional Capability Appraisal:) '
(CMMI Maturity Level 3 or higher appraisal is preferred and will receive supplementary technical evaluation consideration.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
