stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 780 Td 14 TL
(SECTION 3: TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE & PLATFORM SPECIFICATIONS) '
(3.1 Technology Stack & Microservices Architecture:) '
(The core IoT Command platform must be engineered using Java, Spring Boot, React, Node.js, and REST APIs, deployed on AWS Cloud Infrastructure with container orchestration \(Docker/Kubernetes\).) '
(3.2 High-Throughput IoT Ingestion:) '
(The platform architecture must reliably ingest, validate, and process real-time telemetry from at least 10,000 edge IoT sensor devices concurrently.) '
(3.3 High Availability & Uptime SLA:) '
(The production cloud system must deliver a minimum 99.9% High Availability SLA with active-passive automated failover and sub-second latency response.) '
(3.4 Data Security & Encryption:) '
(All data at rest must be encrypted using AES-256 and data in transit via TLS 1.3 protocol.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
