stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 780 Td 14 TL
(SECTION 4: KEY PERSONNEL BENCH, PROJECT SCHEDULE & COMMERCIAL TERMS) '
(4.1 Key Personnel & Engineering Bench:) '
(The Bidder must field dedicated key personnel including a certified Project Manager \(PMP/PRINCE2 with 8+ years experience\) and a Senior Cloud Solution Architect. Total engineering headcount must be at least 40 full-time staff.) '
(4.2 Project Implementation Schedule:) '
(Complete supply, deployment, and commissioning must be achieved within 180 Days from contract signing date.) '
(4.3 Earnest Money Deposit \(EMD\):) '
(An EMD of 2% of total estimated tender value \(INR 1,700,000\) in the form of an irrevocable Bank Guarantee must be furnished.) '
(4.4 Liquidated Damages:) '
(Delay in commissioning shall attract liquidated damages at 0.5% per week up to a ceiling of 10% of total contract value.) '
ET
endstream
